    "body": "This mostly removes a no-op and meaningless bool fallback in the `fundrawtransaction` RPC.\r\n\r\nThis allows to remove a `skip_type_check`.\r\n\r\nAlso, this makes validating the JSON schema more consistent. A few trivial refactors after https://github.com/bitcoin/bitcoin/pull/34683 are included here.",
